"Rs 39.96 cr; ~2.2% of mcap","headline":"receives a **Rs 39.96 crore purchase order** from an undisclosed domestic customer for helicopter helmets, over 8-9 months","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/VINYAS_07102026114319_Intimation_under_SEBI_LODR_Reg_30_.pdf","mcap":1818.1,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/VINYAS_07102026114319_Intimation_under_SEBI_LODR_Reg_30_.pdf"},{"symbol":"SILVERTUC","ticker":"SILVERTUC","company":"Silver Touch Technologies Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 35.63 cr incl. GST; ~2.1% of mcap","headline":"receives a **Rs 35.63 crore purchase order from ITI** for 80 enterprise servers for an Indian Army project","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/69a59d99-7731-4501-b324-f604a7120bae.pdf","mcap":1597.6,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/69a59d99-7731-4501-b324-f604a7120bae.pdf"},{"symbol":"TAKYON","ticker":"TAKYON","company":"Takyon Networks Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 2.56 cr; ~10.5% of mcap","headline":"receives a **Rs 2.56 crore work order from Banaras Locomotive Works** to upgrade its RailNet network, over nine months","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/c7903c50-e23a-45d8-870c-fac67b3e2496.pdf","mcap":24.6,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/c7903c50-e23a-45d8-870c-fac67b3e2496.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Swastika Infra** — receives a **Rs 615.76 crore (incl. taxes) Letter of Award from MSEDCL** for ADB-funded distribution infrastructure and system-strengthening works in Mumbai's Bhandup zone, over 24 months _(~90.2% of mcap)_.","**Dilip Buildcon** — receives PNGRB's grant of authorisation for the Paradip-Raipur LPG pipeline after its 9 September LoI; EPC work of about **Rs 1,800 crore (excl. GST)** is proposed to be awarded to it by its own 100% SPV _(~27.1% of mcap)_.","**Modern Engineering and Projects** — wins a **Rs 113.26 crore (excl. GST) Letter of Award from Neelachal Ispat Nigam** for area-grading works at its expansion project, an item-rate order due in six months _(~321% of mcap)_.","**Om Power Transmission** — receives another **GETCO Letter of Intent, Rs 78.84 crore (incl. GST)**, for the turnkey 220 kV D/C Chorania-Salejda transmission line, after two LoIs on 6 October _(~13.9% of mcap)_.","**SMR Jewels** — receives **jewellery orders worth Rs 67.00 crore** from multiple domestic vendors at the Couture India Show, confirmed on 6-7 October _(~38.2% of mcap)_.","**Vinyas Innovative Technologies** — receives a **Rs 39.96 crore purchase order** from an undisclosed domestic customer to supply and replace helicopter helmets, over 8-9 months _(~2.2% of mcap)_.","**Silver Touch Technologies** — receives a **Rs 35.63 crore (incl. GST) purchase order from ITI** for 80 enterprise servers for an Indian Army project; an optional Rs 14.04 crore eight-year AMC may follow _(~2.1% of mcap)_.","**ITCONS E-Solutions** — wins a **Rs 3.03 crore (incl. taxes) one-year contract** from the Rajiv Gandhi National Institute of Youth Development to deploy 79 staff _(~1.4% of mcap)_.","**Takyon Networks** — receives a **Rs 2.56 crore work order from Banaras Locomotive Works** to upgrade its RailNet/internet network, over nine months _(~10.5% of mcap)_.","**Presstonic Engineering** — receives a **Rs 1.42 crore purchase order from Titagarh Rail Systems** for cable ducts for the first two Vande Bharat Sleeper train sets _(~2.2% of mcap)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**D. P. Abhushan** — calls an EGM on 29 October for up to 8,66,434 shares at Rs 1,430 (**Rs 123.90 crore**) to 54 proposed allottees, among them Finavenue Growth Fund and Tattvam AIF Trust's Aanjay Ageless AIF Fund.","**Ola Electric Mobility** — fixes its partly paid rights issue at **Rs 27 a share for Rs 999.74 crore**, 2 for every 25 held on the 13 October record date; it opens on 22 October, 60% payable on application.","**Shraddha Prime Projects** — sets a **Rs 96.96 crore rights issue**: 60,60,150 shares at Rs 160, three for every 20 held on the 15 October record date, Rs 144 payable on application _(~14.4% of mcap)_.","**Mega Nirman and Industries** — board approves a fresh **rights issue of up to Rs 50 crore**, replacing a withdrawn application, subject to a postal ballot closing 6 November _(~35.2% of mcap)_.","**One Point One Solutions** — receives NSE and BSE in-principle approval for 15 lakh warrants to a non-promoter at not less than Rs 60 each (**at least Rs 9 crore**, our arithmetic)."],"equity_allotments":["**Alankit** — converts 1.65 crore of the warrants allotted on 5 October to promoter-group member Alka Agarwal into shares at Rs 8.60 (**Rs 14.19 crore**, our arithmetic)."],"m_and_a":["**Inox Green Energy Services** — subsidiary Vibhav Energy pays **Rs 550 crore** for Wind World India's 4.5 GW wind O&M business under the NCLT-approved resolution plan; the transfer completes once BTA conditions are met _(~9.3% of mcap)_.","**Tavexia Lifecare** — board approves taking **60% of Meyonex Pharmaceuticals by subscribing to fresh shares at Rs 32, for Rs 67.19 crore** _(~146% of mcap)_, subject to definitive agreements, and may raise funds to finance it.","**Adani Energy Solutions** — signs an SPA with PFC Consulting to buy 100% of Satara Power Transmission at face value, the SPV for the Rs 4,700 crore Maharashtra transmission project it won in August.","**Dixon Technologies** — signs a joint-venture agreement under which Gemtek Technology will hold 40% of subsidiary Dixon Electroconnect to make optical transceivers in India; completion is expected by 3 February 2027 (value not disclosed).","**Maharashtra Seamless** — board approves demerging its Mangaon (1,25,000 MTPA) and Narketpally (2,00,000 MTPA) seamless-pipe units into two wholly owned subsidiaries; together 31.82% of FY26 turnover (our sum).","**Abans Financial Services** — buys a further 6.01% of NBFC subsidiary Abans Finance from Siddhant Commercials at Rs 111 a share (**Rs 22.99 crore**, our arithmetic), lifting its holding to 99.98%.","**Nimbus Projects** — agrees to invest **Rs 15 crore** in Sankalp Agencies' commercial real-estate project at Hari Nagar, New Delhi, for a share of project returns, without taking equity _(~4.0% of mcap)_.","**Veranda Learning Solutions** — demerged J.K. Shah Commerce Education allots 9.65 crore shares one-for-one to Veranda's holders and ceases to be its subsidiary; listing approval is awaited.","**Anant Raj** — its Singapore cloud subsidiary and Orange Business sign an MoU with Haryana's industries department to market Haryana-hosted Ashok Cloud and data-centre services overseas (no value).","**Organic Recycling Systems** — signs an MoU with Aditya Birla Chemicals (Thailand)'s Advanced Materials business to explore composite-waste recycling with its Recyclamine epoxy technology; no consideration is involved.","**Sudarshan Pharma Industries** — terminates its proposal to buy 9.50% of US-based Med Therapy Biotechnology; its promoters' parallel purchase proposals also stand terminated."],"capex_core":["**Polyplex Corporation** — material subsidiary Polyplex (Thailand) approves a second-hand five-layer BOPP/BOPE film line adding 12,000 MT a year by Q4 FY28, for **USD 15.2 million (~Rs 147 crore, per the filing)** _(~4.6% of mcap)_.","**S.J.S. Enterprises** — readies a **Rs 45 crore** capacity addition at Bengaluru, about 20% over its existing ~30 crore parts a year, with commercial production expected in Q3 FY27.","**Patel Chem Specialities** — completes the expansion of its Talod, Gujarat plant, lifting capacity from 720 MTPA to 4,500 MTPA; trial batches have begun.","**Kanoria Chemicals & Industries** — launches a new 12 TPD triacetin plant at its existing Ankleshwar, Gujarat site, for food and pharma customers in India and abroad."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 11 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Kalyan Jewellers India** — Q2 FY27 consolidated revenue grows in excess of 26% YoY, India about 27% with same-store growth of about 20%; the network reaches 546 showrooms.","**Senco Gold** — Q2 FY27 standalone revenue rises 31% YoY, retail 29% and same-store sales 19%, with six new showrooms taking the network to 215.","**PC Jeweller** — Q2 FY27 consolidated revenue grows about 28% YoY; it recovers about Rs 142 crore of export receivables and becomes free of bank debt.","**Jubilant FoodWorks** — Q2 FY27 consolidated revenue rises **11.9% YoY to Rs 26,087 million**, with Domino's India like-for-like growth of 4.1% and 3,820 stores.","**Tata Steel** — Q2 FY27 India crude steel output rises 10% YoY to 6.21 million tons and deliveries 7% to 5.97 million tons (provisional).","**Satin Creditcare Network** — consolidated AUM rises about 31% YoY to about Rs 16,600 crore at September-end, with Q2 FY27 disbursements up 41% to Rs 3,697 crore.","**Matrimony.com** — Q2 FY27 consolidated billings rise **10.7% YoY to Rs 131.09 crore**, and H1 billings 9.2% to Rs 267.11 crore.","**PNGS Gargi Fashion Jewellery** — Q2 FY27 revenue from operations rises 16.21% YoY to Rs 53.98 crore, with 136 points of sale.","**Rathi Steel and Power** — Q2 FY27 sales volume rises **28.86% YoY to 32,028 MT**, and revenue exceeds Rs 200 crore, up more than 30% (unaudited).","**Allcargo Terminals** — September volumes fall 7% YoY to 61.8 thousand TEUs, and 6% month on month.","**Rajshree Sugars & Chemicals** — September operating data: sugar sales at one factory rise to 4,793 MT from 2,752 MT a year earlier, and at another to 1,784 MT from 788 MT.","**Fino Payments Bank** — September renewal income rises 20% YoY to Rs 28.0 crore and average deposits 13% to Rs 2,794 crore, while new deposit accounts fall 17%.","**IZMO** — subsidiary izmo Microsystems signs an MoU with IIT Madras for phase II of a Rs 99.94 crore MeitY silicon-photonics programme, committing Rs 2.40 crore of its own.","**MRF** — a Kerala rectification order **cuts an FY2014-15 CST demand from Rs 91.53 crore to Rs 36.19 crore**; MRF is weighing a challenge to the balance.","**Bharat Forge** — a Delhi High Court division bench dismisses T K Jain's appeal, upholding the order that set aside the arbitral award in his favour.","**UFO Moviez India** — settles all disputes with TSR Films under their 2023 in-cinema advertising agreement and signs a fresh advertisement-rights buyout agreement.","**Kairosoft AI Solutions** — the Delhi High Court quashes a reassessment order and notice for AY 2016-17 as time-barred."],"distress_risk":["**Polycab India** — NCLT Ahmedabad admits Asier Metals' Section 9 insolvency petition over an alleged **Rs 2.79 crore** operational debt; Polycab, citing over Rs 4,000 crore of net cash, is appealing to NCLAT.","**Torrent Power** — a subsidiary's 300 MW SECI wind power purchase agreement is terminated after force-majeure and grid-connectivity delays, with **Rs 39.78 crore** of liquidated damages payable.","**SMVD Poly Pack** — has realised Rs 47.67 crore of insurance against a surveyor-assessed fire loss of Rs 53.59 crore and is suing Oriental Insurance in the Kolkata High Court for the shortfall."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Adani Enterprises** — CARE **upgrades its long-term rating to AA/Stable from AA-/Stable**, its highest ever, and reaffirms A1+ on short-term facilities and commercial paper.","**Sarda Energy & Minerals** — CRISIL **upgrades its long-term bank facilities to AA/Stable from AA-/Positive**, and lifts subsidiary Sarda Metals & Alloys to AA-/Stable from A/Positive.","**Manba Finance** — CARE **upgrades its bank facilities and NCDs to A-/Stable from BBB+/Positive**.","**Torrent Pharmaceuticals** — India Ratings affirms IND AA+ and **revises the outlook to Positive from Stable**.","**Steel Authority of India** — CARE reaffirms AA on long-term bank facilities and **revises the outlook to Positive from Stable**.","**Mukka Proteins** — CARE reaffirms BBB-/A3 and **revises the outlook to Stable from Negative** on improved Q1 FY27 performance.","**Spandana Sphoorty Financial** — India Ratings affirms IND BBB+ on its NCDs and bank loans and **revises the outlook to Stable**."],"other_notable":["**Batliboi** — board approves up to 13,21,585 shares at Rs 113.50 to chairman Nirmal Bhogilal to convert a **Rs 15 crore** promoter loan, plus 6,10,114 shares for his preference shares, subject to members.","**63 moons technologies** — subsidiary 63SATS Cybertech allots 8.10 crore shares to its investor on converting optionally convertible debentures, leaving 63 moons with 60.43%."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/f51fa279-8746-4ab9-836a-b43b4cc06cdb.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/2165b720-fb3c-4e70-aa2f-4fd6e4d1bfac.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/d0976f37-01b9-434b-b199-5c8f4be42f11.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/371626da-7ab2-4714-b425-992f9884615d.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/529b97a6-c6df-4d50-82